# Runtime state that IS committed back across GitHub Actions runs:
#   - data/state.json        (dedup hashes + last-run timestamp)
#   - data/digest/*.jsonl    (watch-tier items accumulated through the day)
# Everything else in data/ is local-only for debugging.
data/outputs/
data/*.db
data/*.sqlite*
*.log
